Question: Which user have only one post history per post and having at least 1000 views?
Evidence: having at least 1000 view refers to Views > = 1000; user refers to UserId

final_sql:
SELECT T1.DisplayName FROM users AS T1 INNER JOIN (
    SELECT UserId, COUNT(*) as CommentCount FROM comments GROUP BY UserId ORDER BY CommentCount DESC LIMIT 1
) AS T2 ON T1.Id = T2.UserId

